      <div class="sec-label">// How it works</div>
      <h2>From zero to receiving<br><em>submissions in minutes</em></h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">No backend to write. No database to manage. Just drop the snippet, point your form, and go.</p>

      <div class="steps-grid reveal">
        <div class="steps-list">

          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">01</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Create an app &amp; define a schema</h3>
              <p>Log into Inbounce, create a new app, and define the fields you expect — names, types, required flags, and uniqueness rules. Invalid data never makes it through.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">02</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Drop the embed snippet</h3>
              <p>Grab the one-line script tag from the Setup tab. Paste it before <code style="color:var(--code);font-size:12px">&lt;/body&gt;</code> on any HTML page and add <code style="color:var(--code);font-size:12px">data-inbounce</code> to your form element.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">03</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Watch submissions roll in</h3>
              <p>Each submission is validated against your schema, geo-enriched from the sender's IP, and lands instantly in your dashboard — filterable by any field.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-hdr">
            <span class="code-lang">html</span>
            <button class="copy-btn" data-copy-target="code-snippet">copy</button>
          </div>
          <pre id="code-snippet"><span class="t-cmt">&lt;!-- 1. Load Inbounce --&gt;</span>
<span class="t-tag">&lt;script</span>
  <span class="t-attr">src</span>=<span class="t-val">"https://inbounce.sh/embed.js"</span>
  <span class="t-attr">data-app</span>=<span class="t-val">"your-app-key"</span>
<span class="t-tag">&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</span>

<span class="t-cmt">&lt;!-- 2. Mark your form --&gt;</span>
<span class="t-tag">&lt;form</span> <span class="t-attr">data-inbounce</span><span class="t-tag">&gt;</span>
  <span class="t-tag">&lt;input</span> <span class="t-attr">name</span>=<span class="t-val">"email"</span>
         <span class="t-attr">type</span>=<span class="t-val">"email"</span> <span class="t-tag">/&gt;</span>
  <span class="t-tag">&lt;textarea</span> <span class="t-attr">name</span>=<span class="t-val">"message"</span><span class="t-tag">&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;</span>
  <span class="t-tag">&lt;button&gt;</span>Send<span class="t-tag">&lt;/button&gt;</span>
<span class="t-tag">&lt;/form&gt;</span>

<span class="t-cmt">&lt;!-- 3. That's it. --&gt;</span></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

